.
.  Create Postscript files (to be converted to gif)
.  for the Negiz4 data.
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
call data.dp
thickness 0.2
tic label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
height 3.5
.
. Starting Step 2 - Model Identification Plots
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na runseqpl.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold

.
. Starting Step 2.1 - Generate a run sequence plot
.
call runseqpl.dp
. Finished Step 2.1: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat runseqpl.ps
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na autocopl.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
device 2 color on
tic label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
.
. Starting Step 2.2 - Generate an autocorrelation plot
.
call autocopl.dp
. Finished Step 2.2: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat autocopl.ps
.
. Starting Step 2.3 - Generate a run sequence plot of Differenced Data
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na runseqp2.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
call runseqp2.dp
. Finished Step 2.1: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat runseqp2.ps
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na autocop2.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
device 2 color on
.
. Starting Step 2.4 - Generate autocorrelation plot of differenced data
.
call autocop2.dp
. Finished Step 2.2: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat autocop2.ps
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na partaupl.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
device 2 color on
.
. Starting Step 2.5 - Generate a partial autocorrelation plot of
.                     the differenced data
.
call partaupl.dp
. Finished Step 2.5: Page Back for Output
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat partaupl.ps
.
. Starting Step 3 - Model Estimation
.
. Starting Step 3.1 - Generate ARMA analysis
.
call arma.dp
.
. Starting Step 4.1 - 4-Plot of Residuals
.
tic label size 5
label size 5
title size 5
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na res4plot.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
call res4plot.dp
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat res4plot.ps
.
tic label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
.
. Starting Step 4.2 - Autocorrelation Plot of Residuals
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na autores1.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
device 2 color on
call autores1.dp
.
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat autores1.ps
.
. Starting Step 4.3 - Lujan-Box Test of Residuals
.
call lujan1.dp
.
. Starting Step 4.4 - 4-Plot of Residuals
.
tic label size 5
label size 5
title size 5
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na res4plo2.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
call res4plo2.dp
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat res4plo2.ps
.
tic label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
.
. Starting Step 4.5 - Autocorrelation Plot of Residuals
.
. device 2 postscript
set ipl1na autores2.gif
device 2 gd gif
device 2 font tektronix
device 2 picture points 400 300
set gd font mediumbold
device 2 color on
call autores2.dp
.
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
. system cp dppl1f.dat autores2.ps
.
. Starting Step 4.6 - Lujan-Box Test of Residuals
.
call lujan2.dp
.
quit
